{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026uXZda9HK0R1795658975.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>今日天氣提提你：</p><p></p><p>一股東北季候風正影響廣東沿岸。同時，一道雲帶亦覆蓋該區。<br/><br/>本港地區今日天氣預測:<br/>大致多雲，日間部分時間天色明朗。稍後有一兩陣微雨。吹輕微至和緩北至東北風。<br/><br/>展望: 未來一兩日漸轉天晴，日間氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大，星期六非常乾燥。星期日風勢頗大。</p><p></p><p>今日天氣預告由專治屙嘔肚痛嘅李萬山脾胃丸帶俾你。</p><p></p><p>09:45 更新</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.860456+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T22:04:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T05:34:46.160927+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:18.060874+00:00","content_hash":"ba8d497ff9dac94961b4fc9c20b4c7261ba104d3c8f80ce1a2b096ec37088eee","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}